      <p class="lede">MeshTalk finds the peers on your network and punches through the NATs to reach the ones that aren't. Nothing is stored in a cloud inbox, because there isn't one.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#install">Install MeshTalk</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#how">See how it connects</a>
